 (PubMed:25330068). Protects neuronal cells from oxidative stress with weaker neuroprotective activity than isoform 5 (By similarity). [Isoform 5]: Exhibits oxidation resistance activity (PubMed:25330068). Protects neuronal cells from oxidative stress with stronger neuroprotective activity than isoform 1 (By similarity). Inhibits endosome-mediated viral entry by inhibiting fusion of the viral and endosomal membranes and subsequent nuclear translocation of viral ribonucleoproteins (PubMed:30478388). Promotes increased cytoplasmic vesicular acidification, lysosomal protease activity and the degradation of endocytosed material (PubMed:30478388)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}